{"id": "csot-2026-11-01-002", "date": "2026-11-01", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 44, "weekday": "Sun"}, "entities": {"companies": ["csot", "tcl"], "customers": ["tcl"], "suppliers": ["csot"]}, "topics": ["oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["mass production"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.9, "reasons": ["多公司提及", "供應鏈上下游同時提及"]}, "title": "TCL CSOT starts moving equipment into its T8 8.6-Gen inkjet printed OLED line, aims for mass production in Q4 2027", "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/csot-oled\">TCL CSOT</a> held a ceremony on October 31 to mark the move-in of the first main process equipment into its T8 fab in Guangzhou, the world's first 8.6-Gen inkjet printed OLED production line. With the equipment moving in, the T8 project moves from the fab construction stage to the equipment installation and commissioning stage.</p><a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/sites/default/files/mcp-uploads/TCL-CSOT-t8-8.6-Gen-IJP-OLED-equipment-move-in.jpg\"", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/tcl-csot-starts-moving-equipment-its-t8-86-gen-inkjet-printed-oled-line-aims", "type": "rss"}]}
